(427, 5, 'Jessica Maminta', 'jessica', '3', 'created document', 'DTS Documents', 'Created document #184347: AD 26-00949\r\n\r\nBig Ticket Program: GEOSPATIAL ANALYSIS RESEARCH HUB: Development and Operationalization of the DOST Geospatial Analytics and Technology Solutions (GATES) Program\r\nProject 1. Navigating the Ocean of Data: DOST-wide data mapping, data cleansing and designing the AI-ready data architecture\r\n\r\nProject 2. Building the Lakehouse: Establishing the DOST Data Lakehouse and GATES interface using geospatial and AI-powered business intelligence and predictive analysis for strategic and tactical data-driven decision-making\r\n\r\nProject 3. Future-ready DOST: Upscaling and integrating Geospatial Analytics and AI in Planning and Decision-making\r\n\r\nProject 4. Sustaining GATES: Institutionalizing and expanding the reach of the GATES Program while developing the DOST Data Science cadre', 'dts_document', '184347', '10.10.101.197', 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36', '{\"subject\":\"AD 26-00949\\r\\n\\r\\nBig Ticket Program: GEOSPATIAL ANALYSIS RESEARCH HUB: Development and Operationalization of the DOST Geospatial Analytics and Technology Solutions (GATES) Program\\r\\nProject 1. Navigating the Ocean of Data: DOST-wide data mapping, data cleansing and designing the AI-ready data architecture\\r\\n\\r\\nProject 2. Building the Lakehouse: Establishing the DOST Data Lakehouse and GATES interface using geospatial and AI-powered business intelligence and predictive analysis for strategic and tactical data-driven decision-making\\r\\n\\r\\nProject 3. Future-ready DOST: Upscaling and integrating Geospatial Analytics and AI in Planning and Decision-making\\r\\n\\r\\nProject 4. Sustaining GATES: Institutionalizing and expanding the reach of the GATES Program while developing the DOST Data Science cadre\",\"classification\":\"False\"}', '2026-07-01 14:02:56', '2026-07-01 14:02:56'),
